\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\tab O GOD of mercy, God of might,
\par \pard\li720 In love and pity inflnite,
\par Teach us, as ever in Thy sight,
\par To live our life to Thee.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab And Thou, who cam'st on earth to die,
\par \pard\li720 That fallen man might live thereby,
\par O hear us, for to Thee we cry,
\par In hope, O Lord, to Thee.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab Teach us the leasson Thou hast taught,
\par \pard\li720 To feel for those Thy blood hath bought,
\par That every word and deed and thought
\par May work a work for Thee.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab For all are brethren, far and wide,
\par \pard\li720 Since Thou, O Lord, for all hast died :
\par Then teach us, whatsoe'er betide,
\par To love them all in Thee.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.\tab In sickness, sorrow, want, or care,
\par \pard\li720 Whate'er it be, 'tis ours to share ;
\par May we, where help is needed, there
\par Give help; as unto Thee.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.\tab and may Thy Holy spirit move
\par \pard\li720 all those who live, to live in love,
\par till Thou shalt greet in heaven above
\par all those who live to Thee.
\par Amen.
\par \pard 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

